---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = { title: 'Privacy Policy' };
---

<Layout metadata={metadata} locale="en">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div
      class="prose-md mx-auto mt-8 max-w-4xl prose prose-lg prose-headings:font-heading prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:leading-tighter prose-headings:tracking-tighter prose-a:text-blue-600 dark:prose-invert dark:prose-headings:text-slate-300 dark:prose-a:text-blue-400"
    >
      <p>Last updated: August 31, 2026</p>
      <p>
        This policy explains what personal information the XuanDun Developer Team website (the “Website”) may collect,
        why we use it, and the choices available to you.
      </p>
      <h2>1. Information we may collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Information you provide:</strong> such as your name, email address, and message when you contact us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Basic technical logs:</strong> such as browser type, access time, referring page, and requested path, used
          to keep the Website secure and reliable.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>2. Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We do not load non-essential third-party analytics or allow them to set cookies unless you select “Accept” in
        the cookie notice. If you decline, those technologies remain disabled. Your choice is stored in your browser's
        local storage so we can remember it without using a consent cookie.
      </p>
      <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to enquiries and communication requests.</li>
        <li>To protect the Website, diagnose faults, and improve performance.</li>
        <li>With your consent and where permitted by law, to understand usage and improve the experience.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>4. Sharing and disclosure</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may disclose information only where necessary:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>To comply with applicable law or a valid request from a judicial or administrative authority.</li>
        <li>To protect the lawful rights and safety of the Website, its users, or the public.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>5. Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain information only for as long as needed for the purposes described here, then delete or anonymize it
        unless a longer period is required by law.
      </p>
      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may ask us to access, correct, or delete information you have submitted, subject to reasonable verification.
      </p>
      <h2>7. Policy updates</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy periodically. Changes take effect when the revised policy is published on this page.
      </p>
      <h2>8. Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about this policy, email us at <a href="mailto:neflibatafeng@gmail.com">neflibatafeng@gmail.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
